--[[
	AdminSystem.lua
	Single-file foundation. Place as a Script in ServerScriptService.
	Branches on RunService:IsServer() — server half builds remotes/permissions/
	registry/executor, client half builds the full UI off the same remotes.
	Chief: this is the foundation. Commands, autocomplete data, and settings
	panels extend CommandRegistry and the UI builder below in later passes.
]]

